{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 02 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稠密预测与医学分割：从像素输出到自配置系统</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_086_u_net-title\">U-Net++</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以 X_i,j 嵌套稠密卷积节点重写 U-Net 跳连，并从多个顶层节点施加深监督。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Rewrites U-Net skip pathways as a dense nested grid of intermediate convolutional nodes X_{i,j} with multi-depth deep supervision.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">2D/3D 医学图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2D or 3D medical image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">深监督融合或选定深度的分割概率图</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Deeply supervised ensemble or depth-pruned segmentation probability map</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1109/TMI.2019.2959609\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_086_u_net')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_086_u_net')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"U-Net++ original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/bd6950062b274aef16bd.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_086_u_net', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_086_u_net\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_086_u_net')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_086_u_net', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_086_u_net\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">进入多尺度卷积 encoder</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d or 3d medical image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"进入多尺度卷积 encoder\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2d or 3d medical image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_086_u_net', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">进入多尺度卷积 encoder</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d or 3d medical image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"沿 i 增大逐级下采样，形成不同语义深度的特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes X_i,0 encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"X_i,0 编码器\" data-node-name-en=\"X_i,0 encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_086_u_net', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">X_i,0 编码器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">X_i,0 encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">沿 i 增大逐级下采样，形成不同语义深度的特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes X_i,0 encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将 X_{i+1,j-1} 上采样到第 i 层分辨率\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs upsampling within the core nested dense skip unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"上采样邻级\" data-node-name-en=\"upsampling\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_086_u_net', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">上采样邻级</span><span class=\"lang-en\">upsampling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将 X_{i+1,j-1} 上采样到第 i 层分辨率</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs upsampling within the core nested dense skip unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"X_i,j=H([X_i,0...X_i,j-1,Up(X_{i+1,j-1})])\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs X_i,j within the core nested dense skip unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"嵌套节点 X_i,j\" data-node-name-en=\"X_i,j\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_086_u_net', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">嵌套节点 X_i,j</span><span class=\"lang-en\">X_i,j</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">X_i,j=H([X_i,0...X_i,j-1,Up(X_{i+1,j-1})])</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs X_i,j within the core nested dense skip unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"同分辨率早期节点全部拼接，逐步缩小 encoder/decoder 语义差\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Dense skip within the core nested dense skip unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Dense skip 路径\" data-node-name-en=\"Dense skip\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_086_u_net', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Dense skip 路径</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense skip</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">同分辨率早期节点全部拼接，逐步缩小 encoder/decoder 语义差</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Dense skip within the core nested dense skip unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"不同 j 构成由浅到深的多个可用 U-Net 子网络\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs U mesh within the core nested dense skip unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"嵌套 U 网格\" data-node-name-en=\"U mesh\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_086_u_net', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">嵌套 U 网格</span><span class=\"lang-en\">U mesh</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">不同 j 构成由浅到深的多个可用 U-Net 子网络</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs U mesh within the core nested dense skip unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从 X_0,1...X_0,J 接多个 segmentation heads 联合训练\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies deep supervision heads to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"深监督 heads\" data-node-name-en=\"deep supervision heads\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_086_u_net', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">深监督 heads</span><span class=\"lang-en\">deep supervision heads</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从 X_0,1...X_0,J 接多个 segmentation heads 联合训练</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies deep supervision heads to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"平均多头或剪枝后选定一个深度 head\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces deeply supervised ensemble or depth-pruned segmentation probability map via Segmentation Output.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"分割输出\" data-node-name-en=\"Segmentation Output\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_086_u_net', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">分割输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Segmentation Output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">平均多头或剪枝后选定一个深度 head</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces deeply supervised ensemble or depth-pruned segmentation probability map via Segmentation Output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"U-Net++ Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · U-Net++ 嵌套稠密跳连节点更新</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · U-Net++ Nested Dense Skip Node Update Equation</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"U-Net++：核心公式 · U-Net++ 嵌套稠密跳连节点更新\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"86\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"11.166097pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.751101 -69.00913 230.241154 11.166097\" width=\"230.241154pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.627713 0V-.158807C4.932934-.23821 4.843605-.297763 4.595469-.893288L3.583077-3.454046L5.260472-5.379578C5.776594-5.955252 6.074357-6.183537 6.50115-6.322492V-6.481299H4.436663V-6.322492C4.923008-6.26294 5.042113-6.193462 5.042113-5.965177C5.042113-5.836147 4.982561-5.726967 4.843605-5.558235L3.404419-3.90069L2.818819-5.359727C2.70964-5.627713 2.669938-5.78652 2.669938-5.91555C2.669938-6.163686 2.828745-6.253014 3.374643-6.322492V-6.481299H.754332V-6.322492C1.330006-6.272865 1.478888-6.173611 1.667471-5.717042L2.719565-3.106656L1.895755-2.143891C.516122-.516122 .23821-.267986-.287837-.158807V0H1.836203V-.158807C1.359783-.158807 1.19105-.248135 1.19105-.496271C1.19105-.645152 1.260528-.803959 1.399484-.962766L2.898223-2.669938L3.563226-1.032244C3.632704-.853586 3.672405-.694779 3.672405-.545898C3.672405-.258061 3.